Comet is now available to everyone, for free

 
Comet started with a simple question: how do we make the internet better?

That journey of questions led us to the ultimate AI browser. Since first launching to Perplexity Max subscribers in July, Comet
has gotten rave reviews and even better with constant feedback. The Comet waitlist ballooned to millions of people, faster than we
could release it.

The only problem left to solve? Making Comet available to everyone.

